==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|госпо́дь}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|Госпо́дь}}
* {{ru-IPA|ɣоспо́дь}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|Госпо́дь|m-an|Го́спода|-}}

# the [[Lord]], [[God]]
#: {{lang|ru|Го́споди!}} ''([[vocative case|vocative]])'' — ''Good Lord!''
#: {{lang|ru|[[не|Не]] [[давать|дай]] Госпо́дь!}} — ''God forbid!''
#: {{lang|ru|Госпо́дь [[он|его́]] [[знать|зна́ет]]!}} — ''God only knows!; Who knows?''
#: {{lang|ru|Госпо́дь [[с#Russian|с]] [[ты|тобо́й]]!}} — ''Bless you!; ''also:'' Get outta here! (incredulity)''
#: {{lang|ru|Госпо́дь [[с#Russian|с]] [[он|ним]]!}} — ''Forget him!''

====Usage notes====
* It's acceptable to pronounce the first letter "[[г]]" as /ɣ/ or /ɦ/ in standard Russian for this word. The [[vocative case]] is more likely to be pronounced with /ɣ/ or /ɦ/. <!--I've heard this opinion but not sure, how to check for frequencies. Not sure if Vahagn is right here. User:Atitarev -->

